{"texts": ["UN ITED ST AT ES OF  AM ERICA\nFEDERAL TRADE COMMISSION\nWASH INGTO N, D .C. 20580\nOffice of t he S ecretary\n August 22, 2008\nJames M. Dester, General Counsel \nFlying J Inc.\n1104 Country Hills Dr.\nOgden, UT 84403 \nRe: Pacific Northwest Gasoline and Diesel Fuel Prices Investigation\n FTC File No. 071-0163\nDear Mr. Dester:\nThe Federal Trade Commission has conducted an investigation of Pacific Northwest\ngasoline and diesel fuel prices.  Upon further review of this matter, it now appears that no further\naction by the Commission is warranted at this time.  Accordingly, the investigation has been\nclosed.  This action is not to be construed as a determination that a violation may not have\noccurred, just as the pendency of an investigation should not be construed as a determination that\na violation has occurred.  The Commission reserves the right to take such further action as the\npublic interest may require.\nBy direction of the Commission.\n Richard C. Donohue\n Acting Secretary"], "vectors": [[-0.04028588533401489, -0.011866318993270397, -0.018611600622534752, 0.028869163244962692, 0.11140841245651245, 0.05638200417160988, -0.06090056896209717, 0.10779501497745514, 0.01716483384370804, -0.00413518026471138, -0.08003509789705276, -0.026017917320132256, -0.049291711300611496, -0.00403548963367939, -0.037005115300416946, 0.019090991467237473, -0.004670470487326384, -0.018995821475982666, -0.01085813157260418, -0.029314255341887474, 0.040303777903318405, 0.03595246002078056, -0.08225524425506592, -0.021579788997769356, 0.031777799129486084, 0.036691587418317795, -0.03908941522240639, -0.04339653626084328, 0.009694653563201427, -0.0020386776886880398, -0.019008124247193336, 0.019839342683553696, -0.050886910408735275, 0.06680139899253845, 0.05599173903465271, -0.0030225864611566067, -0.017511853948235512, -0.045118995010852814, 0.06290614604949951, 0.0015886598266661167, 0.03599260747432709, -0.06719230860471725, -0.06615935266017914, -0.01365430001